        "text": "- Explicitness: EXPLICIT. When the story gets there, sex happens on the page, directly and at length: anatomy, sensation, rhythm, sound, mess, humor, awkwardness, in plain concrete words. No fade to black, no summarizing the act, no euphemism, no purple prose, no moralizing, no disclaimers. Desire and build-up get the same honesty.",
