        "label": "Romance",
        "text": "- Genre lens: romance. The central question is whether these people end up together and what it costs them. Every scene moves the relationship closer, further or sideways. Obstacles come from who they are (fears, loyalties, pride, obligations), not random noise. Favor proximity, misread signals, private moments in public places, gestures that say more than words.",
